{"id":"steam-544360","steam":544360,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Project Amaranth","summary":"A class-based, movement oriented, dungeon-crawling, feature-creeped, multiplayer, platforming game.","about":"A Platforming Dungeon Crawler with a strong focus on cooperative play. Explore the world of Nona with your friends or adventure solo.\r\n\r\nProject Amaranth is an ambitious game a group of friends started back in High School. Now it is a lifelong passion project.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\nFeatures\n\r\n\n\r\n• A movement system with a high skill ceiling.\r\n• A versatile map editor. The player can create their own worlds!\r\n• 10 playable classes\r\n• Challenging Dungeons to explore.\r\n• Cooperative gameplay.\r\n• A variety of game modes.\n\r\n\r\nNeutral  is the default element everyone spawns as. Find an elemental shrine to transform into one of the 9 elemental forms. Each element has its own unique move set, animations, and abilities. The player can choose between them to suit their play style and the challenges of each dungeon.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe movement system is challenging, but will reward players with a variety of engaging agility options.\r\nSingle-player and multiplayer is supported, as well as syncing custom maps and dungeons. A separate server client is needed to host a multiplayer world\r\n\r\n\nDevelopers Wanted\n\r\nWe are a small, passionate team that is looking for additional developers. Whether you are still learning or experienced, we would love to get you on board. \r\nPlease see the Discord for additional information. This is a passion project, not a job offer.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/dc10ddc481f4669800cdb4aa99c66c21d7d78733/library_600x900.jpg?t=1732679958","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/header.jpg?t=1732679958","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/0cea7b755b35fcd523e749de7028d71ca8c7